  "details": "Feature Request: OSC Support for  Get Chat Box Content\n\nDear VRChat Team\n\nI would like to suggest adding functionality to the OSC that allows external applications to get text from the VRChat Chatbox.\n\nCurrently, there is no way to obtain text entered in the VRChat chat box in real-time through external applications. If chat content could be obtained through OSC, the following would be possible:\n\nProcessing chat text entered in VRChat with external text analysis tools or translation tools, and feeding back the results to VRChat via OSC.\n\nChanging avatar expressions and effects according to chat content.\n\nRecording and analyzing chat logs with external applications.\n\nThis addition would help make communication in VRChat smoother and more accessible, allowing for more dynamic interactions with the Chatbox.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nBest regards",
